# Boot images known to boot and run well on this watch (TicWatch Pro 3 Ultra,
# rover, AsteroidOS 2.1). flash-recovery.sh writes a trial to `recovery` only
# while `boot` holds one of these, so a failed trial always falls back to a
# good kernel; `--fallback IMAGE` writes one of these to `recovery`.
